  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Lengthening</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Parabens</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Volumizing</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>An endlessly buildable mascara that lengthens, defines, and volumizes for a natural to bold lash with a clean, pigment-rich, and flake-free formula.<strong><br><br>Formulation Type: </strong>Volumizing, Lengthening</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Long-wearing, Waterproof</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Carnauba and Candelilla Wax Blend: Ultra-creamy texture for maximum build.</p><p>- Shea Butter: Nourishes and protects lashes.</p><p>- Plant-Derived Ester: Rich pigment payoff that boosts wear time.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan, cruelty-free, and comes in recyclable packaging.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Hold the brush horizontally at the base of the lashes and use a slight side-to-side wiggling motion to build thickness and volume. <br>-Washes off effortlessly with mild soap and water.<br>-Gucci Westman&rsquo;s tip: &quot;One swipe is all I need for a natural look. It&rsquo;s done, but not too done. I like to work the wand from side to side as I move toward the tips to catch every little lash. Then for an evening look, I&rsquo;ll push the length and thickness with a few more layers.&quot;</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p>WATER (AQUA) EUPHORBIA CERIFERA (CANDELILLA) WAX [EUPHORBIA CERIFERA CERA] BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER [BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII BUTTER] POLYGLYCERYL-6 DISTEARATE DIMER DILINOLEYL DIMER DILINOLEATE COPERNICIA CERIFERA (CARNAUBA) WAX [COPERNICIA CERIFERA WAX] GLYCERIN POLYGLYCERYL-10 MYRISTATE CETYL ALCOHOL GLYCERYL CAPRYLATE LEUCONOSTOC/RADISH ROOT FERMENT FILTRATE XANTHAN GUM ARGININE PHENETHYL ALCOHOL IRON OXIDES (CI 77499)</p><p><br></p><p><strong>.\t</p><br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Lengthening</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Parabens</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Volumizing</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>An endlessly buildable mascara that lengthens, defines, and volumizes for a natural to bold lash with a clean, pigment-rich, and flake-free formula.<strong><br><br>Formulation Type: </strong>Volumizing, Lengthening</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Long-wearing, Waterproof</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Carnauba and Candelilla Wax Blend: Ultra-creamy texture for maximum build.</p><p>- Shea Butter: Nourishes and protects lashes.</p><p>- Plant-Derived Ester: Rich pigment payoff that boosts wear time.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan, cruelty-free, and comes in recyclable packaging.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Hold the brush horizontally at the base of the lashes and use a slight side-to-side wiggling motion to build thickness and volume. <br>-Washes off effortlessly with mild soap and water.<br>-Gucci Westman&rsquo;s tip: &quot;One swipe is all I need for a natural look. It&rsquo;s done, but not too done. I like to work the wand from side to side as I move toward the tips to catch every little lash. Then for an evening look, I&rsquo;ll push the length and thickness with a few more layers.&quot;</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p>WATER (AQUA) EUPHORBIA CERIFERA (CANDELILLA) WAX [EUPHORBIA CERIFERA CERA] BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER [BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII BUTTER] POLYGLYCERYL-6 DISTEARATE DIMER DILINOLEYL DIMER DILINOLEATE COPERNICIA CERIFERA (CARNAUBA) WAX [COPERNICIA CERIFERA WAX] GLYCERIN POLYGLYCERYL-10 MYRISTATE CETYL ALCOHOL GLYCERYL CAPRYLATE LEUCONOSTOC/RADISH ROOT FERMENT FILTRATE XANTHAN GUM ARGININE PHENETHYL ALCOHOL IRON OXIDES (CI 77499)</p><p><br></p><p><strong>.\t</p><br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>"